From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aleksandrs Vinarskis <alex.vinarskis@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Apr 2025 21:29:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] UBUNTU: SAUCE: arm64: dts: qcom: x1e80100-dell-xps13-9345:
 enable MICs LDO

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2121477

Particular device comes without headset combo jack, hence does not
feature wcd codec IC. In such cases, DMICs are powered from vreg_l1b.
Describe both microphones in the audio routing. vdd-micb is defined
for lpass-macro already.

Signed-off-by: Aleksandrs Vinarskis <alex.vinarskis@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Neil Armstrong <neil.armstrong@linaro.org>
Signed-off-by: Abel Vesa <abel.vesa@linaro.org>
(cherry picked from commit 9f01431f5de7751af00ca7429a486467a753ede2 gitlab.com/Linaro/arm64-laptops/linux)
Signed-off-by: Tobias Heider <tobias.heider@canonical.com>
Signed-off-by: Timo Aaltonen <timo.aaltonen@canonical.com>
Signed-off-by: Paolo Pisati <paolo.pisati@canonical.com>
Ledger-Change: C-00294
Ledger-Origin: ubuntu@6546e8170acd4ed13f4e1f1e873eabb5bb330aab
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-dell-xps13-9345.dts | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-dell-xps13-9345.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-dell-xps13-9345.dts
index 8afc2e89c17b..db3132f7b6e0 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-dell-xps13-9345.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-dell-xps13-9345.dts
@@ -157,7 +157,9 @@ sound {
 		audio-routing = "WooferLeft IN", "WSA WSA_SPK1 OUT",
 				"TweeterLeft IN", "WSA WSA_SPK2 OUT",
 				"WooferRight IN", "WSA2 WSA_SPK1 OUT",
-				"TweeterRight IN", "WSA2 WSA_SPK2 OUT";
+				"TweeterRight IN", "WSA2 WSA_SPK2 OUT",
+				"VA DMIC0", "vdd-micb",
+				"VA DMIC1", "vdd-micb";
 
 		wsa-dai-link {
 			link-name = "WSA Playback";
